pipeline_info/*
**/*.tbi
**/*.gzi
**/*_bgcs.json
# IntegronFinder summary embeds the run command line (incl. --cpu N), so its md5
# changes with CPU allocation. Verify presence (stable_name) but not content.
**/*_contigs.summary
# ice_genes.tsv has a gene_annot column of BLASTP best-hit UniProt product names.
# Best-hit selection varies by CPU architecture (arm64 dev vs x86 CI), so its md5 is
# not portable. The ICE call itself (ices.tsv + the feature in mobilome.gff) is stable
# and stays content-asserted; here we verify presence (stable_name) but not content.
**/*_ice_genes.tsv
